    "title": "Will Giants add a second baseman? Nico Hoerner among players they're eyeing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago Second base is an area the San Francisco Giants might look to add this winter, but it's a secondary pursuit after starting pitching and, perhaps, upgrading the outfield. Should the Giants fail to get a significant outfield bat, second becomes a spot where Buster Posey and Zach Minasian can inject a little more offense, and they've scoured the free-agent and trade markets for targets, including Brendan Donovan, Ketel Marte and Brandon Lowe. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
